/* x86_64-only legacy syscalls (not in the asm-generic table).  Spare slots
 * 1003-1007 keep them reachable through the x86 mapping table without
 * colliding with asm-generic numbers.  time/utime/utimes are thin wire-format
 * wrappers over the timekeeping/VFS core; pause parks until a signal arrives;
 * get_thread_area reports the FS-base TLS pointer carried in the trap frame. */
