/* LINUX_ABI_PLACEHOLDER_RESOLUTION_CONTRACT: the entries below were originally
 * deliberate Linux-compatibility placeholders returning fixed -ENOSYS.
 * They are now real implementations backed by kernel subsystems (fanotify,
 * acct, keyring, AIO, modules, userfaultfd, perf software events); the
 * remaining -ENOSYS returns are the arch/version-correct Linux semantics
 * (nfsservctl removed in 4.19, map_shadow_stack is x86-only, riscv_*
 * syscalls are RISC-V-only, arch_prctl is x86-only).  See
 * kernel/abi/linux/syscall_coverage.md "Placeholder Resolution Record". */
